# Scene & Engine

- Preserve FIXED vs VARIABLE loop semantics and `gameLoopThreshold` clamping.
- Search indexes must remain gated by `SceneConfig`; missing enablement should throw (existing UX).
- `clearScene` must refuse when `isUpdating`; offer async/delay path.
- `callWithDelay` runs after the update tree; `delay: 0` is end-of-frame.
- Built-in attribute/state/flag/tag messages only when `notify*Changes` is true.
- Keep `Messages` enum stable; add new built-ins carefully and document them.
- After clearScene, stage is a new Container — debug injection and global rehydration must still work.

See `docs/core-api.md` and `docs/lifecycle.md`.
